2. For the purposes of section 337(2)(c) of the Code, the following are prescribed offences:
(a)an offence under section 14A(2) of the Miscellaneous Offences (Public Order and Nuisance) Act (Cap. 184) read with section 14A(3)(b) of that Act;
(b)an offence under section 117, 281, 295, 317, 379A, 380, 381, 428, 494 (as in force before 1 January 2020) or 496 (as in force before 1 January 2020) of the Penal Code (Cap. 224);
[S 853/2019 wef 01/01/2020]
(c)an offence under section 304A of the Penal Code committed by doing a rash act;
(d)an offence under section 312 of the Penal Code, where the woman’s pregnancy is of more than 16 weeks’ duration as mentioned in that section;
[S 853/2019 wef 01/01/2020]
(e)an offence under section 6A(b) or 6C of the Women’s Charter (Cap. 353).
[S 853/2019 wef 01/01/2020]
